"id": "service-quote",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section service-quote\" id=\"service-quote\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Safety-switch and RCD repair costs in Perth</h2><div class=\"price-guide\" aria-labelledby=\"ellis-price-guide\">\n            <div class=\"shell\">\n              <div class=\"price-guide__intro\">\n                <p class=\"price-guide__kicker\">Ellis Price Guide</p>\n                <h2 id=\"ellis-price-guide\">Safety-switch price guide</h2>\n                <p>\n                  A practical guide for standard safety-switch testing and\n                  component replacement at a Perth property.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"price-guide__grid\">\n                <article class=\"price-guide__item\">\n                  <h3>Safety-switch diagnosis & testing</h3>\n                  <p class=\"price-guide__range\">AUD $220–$440</p>\n                  <p class=\"price-guide__unit\">per attendance · incl. GST</p>\n                </article>\n                <article class=\"price-guide__item\">\n                  <h3>RCD / RCBO replacement</h3>\n                  <p class=\"price-guide__range\">AUD $220–$330</p>\n                  <p class=\"price-guide__unit\">per device · incl. GST</p>\n                </article>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"price-guide__notice\">\n                <strong>Guide conditions:</strong> These AUD ranges are for\n                standard-hours, standard-scope work and are incl. GST. Access,\n                materials, extra pipe, cable or circuit work, compliance work,\n                emergency or after-hours work and unforeseen repairs are\n                confirmed in a written quote before work proceeds.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div><h3>What your written quote covers</h3><p>Tripping is a symptom, not a diagnosis. The affected circuits, connected equipment, access and investigation findings determine whether the work concerns an appliance-related issue, wiring, a connection or a protective device. The quote describes the identified repair rather than assuming the switch itself is the only cause.</p><p>The final written quote sets out the work included, materials and any agreed additional tasks. We explain changes to the scope before extra work proceeds. <a href=\"contact.html?service=safety-switch-tripping-perth.html\">Request a safety-switch and rcd repair quote</a>.</p></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "service-faq",
"kind": "faq",
"container": "\n<section class=\"section faq service-editorial-faq\" id=\"service-faq\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Safety Switch &amp; RCD Repairs Perth FAQs</h2><!-- site-intent:start --><div class=\"intent-content\" data-site-intent><h3>Repeated trips do not identify the failed component</h3><p>An RCD or safety switch and a circuit breaker perform different protective roles. Note the label only if it is safely readable; do not open covers to identify the device. Appliances, wiring and the protective device can require different investigation before replacement is considered.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"power-faults-perth.html\">Electrical fault investigation</a></li><li><a href=\"insights-safety-switch-keeps-tripping.html\">What to record when a safety switch trips</a></li><li><a href=\"smoke-alarm-maintenance-perth.html\">Separate smoke-alarm maintenance requests</a></li><li><a href=\"power-points-perth.html\">Power Point Installation &amp; Repairs Perth</a></li><li><a href=\"switchboard-upgrades-perth.html\">Switchboard Repairs &amp; Upgrades Perth</a></li><li><a href=\"rcd-testing-perth.html\">RCD Testing &amp; Safety Switch Checks Perth</a></li><li><a href=\"emergency-electrician-perth.html\">24-Hour Emergency Electrician Perth</a></li></ul><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:0:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:0:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:1:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:1:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:2:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:2:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:3:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:3:answer}}</details></div><!-- site-intent:end --><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:4:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:4:answer}}</details>\n<details><summary>{{ppp:faq:5:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:5:answer}}</details>\n<details><summary>{{ppp:faq:6:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:6:answer}}</details>\n<details><summary>{{ppp:faq:7:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:7:answer}}</details>\n<details><summary>{{ppp:faq:8:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:8:answer}}</details>\n<details><summary>{{ppp:faq:9:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:9:answer}}</details></div></section>" as TrustedHtml,
"items": [
{
"question": "Is a safety switch the same as a circuit breaker?",
"answer": "<p>No. The devices have different protective functions. If you are unsure which has operated, report the affected rooms and any safely visible label. The electrician identifies the device and assessment needed.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Can replacing the RCD guarantee that tripping will stop?",
"answer": "<p>No. Tripping can be associated with another part of the installation or connected equipment. The cause needs assessment; replacing the protective device without that assessment may not resolve the fault.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "What is the difference between an RCD and a circuit breaker?",
"answer": "<p>An RCD detects leakage imbalance; a circuit breaker responds to overload or short circuit. A combined device can do both. <a href=\"#learn-about-safety-switch-tripping-perth\">Read the explanation.</a></p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Does a tripping safety switch mean the switch itself is faulty?",
"answer": "<p>No. Tripping can originate in connected equipment or wiring, so replacing the switch alone may not resolve it. <a href=\"#learn-about-safety-switch-tripping-perth\">Read the explanation.</a></p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Do I need to diagnose the problem first?",
"answer": "<p>No. Describe the observable change and property context. We inspect the affected area on site to establish the cause and confirm the repair scope. If more access is needed, we agree it with you first.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Can I send photos?",
"answer": "<p>Photos are optional: email safely taken photos to maxinemaintenance.au@outlook.com. You can contact us without photos. Do not approach a hazard, remove covers or dismantle equipment to take a photo.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Why does a safety switch trip?",
"answer": "<p>There can be several causes. The most useful first step is to record what was happening and avoid trying to diagnose fixed wiring yourself.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Can I open the switchboard?",
"answer": "<p>No. Do not open switchboards or remove covers.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "What should I tell Ellis Services Group?",
"answer": "<p>Include the affected areas, when it happened, what was in use and any safely observable warning signs.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Will replacing the safety switch stop the tripping?",
"answer": "<p>Not necessarily. Tripping can relate to more than the device itself. We investigate the relevant fault and explain whether device replacement or another identified repair is appropriate before quoting.</p>" as TrustedHtml
}
]
},
{
"id": "service-booking",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section contact-band service-booking\" id=\"service-booking\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Book safety-switch and rcd repair in Perth</h2><p>Send the suburb, the areas affected, whether the device trips repeatedly or will not stay on, and any recent changes. Do not open the switchboard to obtain model information. Our local team covers <a href=\"service-areas.html\">all six Perth service regions</a> from our office at 140 St Georges Terrace, Perth WA 6000.</p><p>Call to discuss the work or send the property details through our enquiry form. You do not need to diagnose the fault or complete a technical inspection before contacting us.</p><a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:0413477667\">Call 0413 477 667</a> <a class=\"button service-book-button\" href=\"contact.html?service=safety-switch-tripping-perth.html\">Request a visit &amp; written quote</a></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
